# NOTE: ./managed is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The compiled contract artifacts (contract bindings, zkir, prover and verifier
# keys) are required at runtime for proof generation, so they are versioned to
# keep the repository self-contained. Regenerate them with `npm run compile`.
